1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:10,247
Gametogenesis turns diploid germ cells into haploid gametes: spermatogenesis in the testis, oogenesis in the ovary.

2
00:00:10,247 --> 00:00:13,242
Both run through three phases.

3
00:00:13,242 --> 00:00:15,729
Multiplication, by mitosis.

4
00:00:15,729 --> 00:00:16,640
Growth.

5
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:21,536
And maturation, two meiotic divisions that halve the chromosome number.

